{"tool_name":"local-z-projector","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p><strong>Local Z Projector</strong> is an ImageJ2 plugin, available in Fiji, that can perform local-Z projection of a 3D stack, possibly over time, possibly very large.</p>\n\n<p>LZP performs projection of a surface of interest on a 2D plane from a 3D image. It is a simple tool that focuses on <strong>usability</strong> and is designed to be <strong>adaptable</strong> to many different use cases and image quality.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>It can work with 3D movies over time with multiple channels.</li>\n\t<li>It can work with images much larger than available RAM out of the box.</li>\n\t<li>It takes advantage of computers with multiple cores, and can be used in scripts.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","summary":"","value":"<p><strong>Local Z Projector</strong> is an ImageJ2 plugin, available in Fiji, that can perform local-Z projection of a 3D stack, possibly over time, possibly very large.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"auto\">LZP performs projection of a surface of interest on a 2D plane from a 3D image. It is a simple tool that focuses on <strong>usability</strong> and is designed to be <strong>adaptable</strong> to many different use cases and image quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\r\n\t<li>It can work with 3D movies over time with multiple channels.</li>\r\n\t<li>It can work with images much larger than available RAM out of the box.</li>\r\n\t<li>It takes advantage of computers with multiple cores, and can be used in scripts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2021-05-05T14:12:49+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2021-05-05T14:00:00+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1620223662,"last_comm